  "roleExampleDevelopment1": "An unwritten graduation plan leads to a friend's sketchbook and a decision to make a short film. Revisiting those memories helps the character find a passion.",
  "roleExampleDevelopment2": "A roommate's strange behavior prompts a secret investigation. A series of comic misunderstandings ends with a surprise farewell party in their classroom.",
  "roleExampleDevelopment3": "A setback breaks through her usual brave face. Her friends support her in small everyday ways until she feels ready to share how tired she is.",
  "roleExampleDevelopment4": "Dinner-table jokes give way to attentive listening. She shares her dream, the others share theirs, and they make a promise to meet again in a year.",
  "roleExampleDevelopment5": "A misunderstanding pulls two friends apart and well-meant interventions make it worse. A rainy-day encounter over hot cocoa finally gives them space to talk.",
  "roleExampleDevelopment6": "Watching a sunrise is the last wish before moving away. Small mishaps bring the friends closer, and their goodbye becomes a promise to meet again.",
  "roleExampleContent1": "Shot 1: A pen hovers over a blank graduation plan beside the window.\nShot 2: Sketchbook photographs alternate with campus memories.\nShot 3: The friends raise a camera and film their first scene at sunset.",
  "roleExampleContent2": "Shot 1: The roommate slips out as friends peek around the door.\nShot 2: Their clumsy investigation takes them across campus.\nShot 3: A classroom door opens onto photographs and party lights.",
  "roleExampleContent3": "Shot 1: She sits at a desk and lets her forced smile fade.\nShot 2: Breakfast, patient waiting and notes show her friends' care.\nShot 3: Surrounded by friends, she rests her head on a shoulder.",
  "roleExampleContent4": "Shot 1: Dinner-table laughter settles as everyone listens.\nShot 2: Each friend writes a dream on a slip of paper.\nShot 3: They seal the notes in a box dated one year from today.",
  "roleExampleContent5": "Shot 1: Two friends pass silently in a hallway.\nShot 2: Rain falls outside a cafe while cocoa steams on the table.\nShot 3: After an honest conversation, they leave under one umbrella.",
  "roleExampleContent6": "Shot 1: A wish list has one unchecked item: watch a sunrise.\nShot 2: Forgotten keys and wrong turns turn into shared laughter.\nShot 3: They stand together in morning light and promise to reunite.",
